111
00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.000
Who's a fish? Who's a fish?

112
00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.000
Tim, stop it. I mean it.

113
00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.000
Look, babe, who's a turkey?

114
00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:23.000
Bawk bawk bawk bawk bawk!

115
