140
00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.000
What's this?

141
00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:01.000
Now, Otis, how many times have I told you?

142
00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:04.000
If you're gonna steal something, steal something with a little value.

143
00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:07.000
That's what we're looking for. Get up here, come on.

144
00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:10.000
Come here.

145
00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:15.000
Thanks, pal. Your kissing is getting a lot better.

146
00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:19.000
You don't want a baby right now, do you?

147
00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:24.000
He said it.

148
00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:27.000
Mmm.

149
00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:36.000
LOKl!

150
00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:47.000
Dad?

151
00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:51.000
I-I mean, Oh, masterful Odin, is that you?

152
00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.000
Have you found your mask, Loki?

153
00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:57.000
I found a mask, but as it turns out,

154
00:10:57.000 --> 00:11:00.000
- it was a fake. - Why are you relaxing on this beach?

155
00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:03.000
I'm just taking a few moments reprieve from my...

156
