181
00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:25.000
And if somebody asks that child, "Hey, what does your mommy do?"

182
00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:29.000
He's gonna say, "Oh, she's the managing director of Apt Apparel."

183
00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:32.000
They'll say, "Cool." When they say, "What does your daddy do?"

184
00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:36.000
They'll say, "He's a... he's a..."

185
00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:40.000
Hey, boys and girls. I'm Torpedo Tortoise!

186
00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:58.000
And here's one for you.

187
00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.000
