210
00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:04.000
- I'm gonna do it. - Are you crazy?

211
00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:15.000
Hey, Torpedo Tortoise.

212
00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:18.000
Hi.

213
00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.000
