236
00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:49.000
Well, honey, you know, we've got so much stuff around here.

237
00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:51.000
I don't know, just... wear that thing.

238
00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:54.000
This?

239
