243
00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:08.000
I know, but I can't. I gotta finish the Orion brochure.

244
00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:11.000
- You know what? - Hmm?

245
00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:14.000
Go to the party...

246
00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:16.000
have fun,

247
00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:18.000
